---
title: ClearFrame — one finding, upload to armed watch
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Producer
    participant API as API
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant W as Worker
    participant PS as Parallel · Search
    participant G as Gemini · Vertex
    participant PT as Parallel · Task
    participant C as Counsel

    U->>API: POST /productions (multipart, screenplay)
    API->>DB: INSERT production, cut, storage_key
    Note over API,DB: the API never calls a model.<br/>it validates, writes a job, and returns.<br/>that is why a pass survives a closed laptop
    API->>DB: ledger ← pass_opened {cut, sha256(file)}
    API->>DB: INSERT job pass.breakdown
    API-->>U: 201 · milliseconds, not minutes

    W->>DB: claim (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    W->>G: breakdown · Pro · responseSchema
    G-->>W: up to 24 items {item, category, scene, page, context}
    Note over W,DB: item_key = CATEGORY|normalised(item).<br/>unique per production. this key is what makes<br/>delta re-clearance possible three cuts from now
    W->>DB: INSERT findings, fan out finding.investigate

    rect rgb(247, 247, 252)
    Note over W,PT: TIER 0/1 — recon on every item
    W->>PS: search(objective, queries) · advanced
    PS-->>W: 8 sources with excerpts
    W->>G: synthesise(item, sources) · Flash
    G-->>W: {summary, evidence[{url, stance, note}]}
    Note over W,G: every url is checked against the retrieved pool.<br/>anything not in it is dropped before INSERT and the<br/>rejected count is written to the activity feed.<br/>a fabricated citation is structurally impossible
    W->>DB: INSERT evidence (ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING) + snapshot
    end

    W->>G: verify(summary, evidence) · Pro
    G-->>W: {sufficient, reason, followUpObjective}

    alt evidence challenged, and budget remains
        Note over W,PT: TIER 2/3 — escalation fires only on a cited<br/>objection. this is what keeps the expensive<br/>processor off the boring 90% of the register
        W->>DB: ledger ← challenge {finding, reason}
        W->>PT: task.create(objective, previous_interaction_id)
        PT-->>W: dossier + citations
        W->>G: re-synthesise with the objection attached
        W->>G: verify again
    else evidence accepted
        Note over W,G: no escalation. the pass spends pennies here
    end

    W->>G: trace chains · Pro
    G-->>W: MUSIC → 2 chains (composition, master)
    Note over W,G: licensing one clears nothing.<br/>an unresolved or contested chain forces human<br/>review regardless of how confident assess reads
    W->>G: assess(summary, evidence, chains, verification)
    G-->>W: {risk, confidence, recommendation, requiresReview}
    W->>DB: ledger ← assessment {risk, confidence}

    alt requiresReview
        W->>DB: status = review
        C->>API: POST /findings/:id/decision
        Note over API,C: requireRole("counsel"). a producer gets 403<br/>regardless of what the client sends
        API->>DB: ledger ← decision {action, rationale, actor}
        API->>DB: INSERT job outreach.draft (if licensed)
    else cleared without review
        W->>DB: status = cleared
    end

    W->>DB: INSERT watch · next_check_at = now() + 24h
    Note over W,DB: a resolved finding is an armed watch,<br/>not a closed row. nothing in the monitoring<br/>path can close a finding. only a person can
